{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game purpose: Who can spend the least time climbing to the top of the Fantasy Tower? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work hard to climb the tower and unlock more game features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can sleep in your home to restore your health and status, you can also store your equipment in your home, and you can even synthesize items </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can exercise in the academy to increase attributes, learn skills, and conduct trials</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can buy and sell in the store and work to earn gold coins </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can collect materials to synthesize items </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to improve the character's attributes through careful arrangements, so as to defeat the enemies in the  tower in the least amount of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current 2.0 version of Fantasy Tower has only been developed to 5 floors. It will be opened in the future. Feedback from players needs to be collected to adjust the content that will be released later.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2920160?t=1764144148","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2920160?t=1764144148","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920160/ada8f57468ed7eff209a455612112b67e5feb675/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764144148","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920160/ada8f57468ed7eff209a455612112b67e5feb675/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764144148","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game purpose: Who can spend the least time climbing to the top of the Fantasy Tower? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work hard to climb the tower and unlock more game features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can sleep in your home to restore your health and status, you can also store your equipment in your home, and you can even synthesize items </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can exercise in the academy to increase attributes, learn skills, and conduct trials</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can buy and sell in the store and work to earn gold coins </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can collect materials to synthesize items </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to improve the character's attributes through careful arrangements, so as to defeat the enemies in the  tower in the least amount of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current 2.0 version of Fantasy Tower has only been developed to 5 floors. It will be opened in the future. Feedback from players needs to be collected to adjust the content that will be released later.</p>","developers":["\u4e2a\u4eba"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920160/6fdaee95477734b82e0b3cc96d15f4f7d194920f/header.jpg?t=1764144148","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"